# Testing Rules

- Any tool/agent/API change requires matching pytest updates.
- Unit tests mock DB and LLM; no live external calls in CI.
- Integration tests use FastAPI `TestClient`.
- Run: `cd backend && pytest app/tests -v`
- Do not delete or skip tests to pass gates.
- Golden questions live in `memory-bank/eval/golden-questions.json`.
